{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126090732077-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126113240\"/><p>今日(26日)為大埔宏福苑大火一周年。該場大火共造成168人死亡，數以千計居民痛失家園。今早陸續有市民前往宏福苑旁的廣福公園悼念，在長椅上擺放鮮花。部分市民獻花後合十閉目默哀，期間眼泛淚光。現場花束附有心意卡，寫上「希望逝者安息，公義得以彰顯」；亦有罹難者家屬到場致意，卡片上寫有「杰仔：爸爸來看你了！」等字句。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T03:50:41.572066+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T01:07:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T04:34:11.202651+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T03:44:10.023443+00:00","content_hash":"cd815c6253ab68160d5cddec7890bb1504e570bac2f6cd8de5d3c107ceaf1acf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}